{
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "{% if timeframe == 'monthly' %}purple{% elif timeframe == 'weekly' %}orange{% else %}blue{% endif %}",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "🌌 GitHub Trend & Activity ({{ persona.name }}) - {{ timeframe | capitalize }}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**🎯 目标画像**: {{ persona.name }} | **时间**: {{ timestamp }}\n已从 {{ total_input }} 个热门候选项目中智能甄选 **{{ repos | length }}** 个最值得关注的 LLM & AI 工程更新。"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {% for r in repos %}
      {
        "tag": "div",
        "text": {
          "tag": "lark_md",
          "content": "**{% if r.rating == 'S' %}👑 [S级高热] {% elif r.rating == 'A' %}🔥 [A级精选] {% else %}🔹 [{{ r.rating }}级推荐] {% endif %}{{ r.full_name }}**\n**🏷️ 标签**: {% for t in r.tags %}`{{ t }}` {% endfor %} | **语言**: `{{ r.language }}` | **热度**: {% if r.period_stars %}{{ r.period_stars }}{% else %}⭐️ {{ r.stars }}{% endif %}\n\n*{{ r.selection_reason }}*\n\n{{ r.chinese_summary | replace('\"', '\\\"') | replace('\n', '\\n') }}"
        },
        "extra": {
          "tag": "button",
          "text": {
            "tag": "plain_text",
            "content": "🔗 View Repo"
          },
          "type": "primary",
          "url": "{{ r.url }}"
        }
      }
      {% if not loop.last %}
      ,{
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %},
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "note",
        "elements": [
          {
            "tag": "plain_text",
            "content": "Multi-model pipeline via OpenRouter + SenseNova."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
